Comment: 0,0:28:57.28,0:28:59.70,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Ending ===
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.28,0:28:59.70,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,And with that, we've reached the end of SekaRaji.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.70,0:29:03.52,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yes, we're always waiting for your submissions to the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.52,0:29:08.32,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Email in your messages to sekairadio@pjsekai.jp.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.32,0:29:12.26,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Please check the official ProSeka X account for more details.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.26,0:29:14.98,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Please send in your messages as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.98,0:29:17.30,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,And don't forget to include your radio name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.30,0:29:22.16,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Now, let's leave a question\Nin the exchange notebook for the next cast members.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.66,0:29:22.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.16,0:29:26.71,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The next episode is scheduled to feature the VBS cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.48,0:29:26.71,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's VBS.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.76,0:29:30.28,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Our question for them is...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.28,0:29:32.41,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,"What do you want to do before the end of the year?"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.41,0:29:33.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Haha!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.72,0:29:35.66,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really is the end of the year, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.56,0:29:38.36,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's only a little over a month left in this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.36,0:29:43.30,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,So I thought even if there's something\Nthey haven't done yet, they might just barely make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.30,0:29:46.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. Still got a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.85,0:29:46.20,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Since there's still a month left,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.20,0:29:48.84,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I'm pretty interested in what they think they'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.84,0:29:50.71,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Do you have anything, Yui-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.71,0:29:52.60,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.60,0:29:54.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.00,0:29:55.60,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I want to redecorate my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.24,0:29:58.76,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,But there's no way I'll make it in just one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.61,0:30:02.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's definitely impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.56,0:30:03.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That takes a lot of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.52,0:30:05.16,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really does, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.16,0:30:07.80,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I'd have to clean up first and everything, so yeah.
Comment: 0,0:30:07.80,0:30:09.24,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.80,0:30:09.24,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's probably not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.24,0:30:10.14,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,But I still want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.14,0:30:11.12,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The motivation is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.12,0:30:14.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The sense of accomplishment afterward is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.97,0:30:14.20,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.20,0:30:16.47,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It'd allow you to get the hard-to-reach spots too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.00,0:30:18.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ooh, that sounds nice too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.16,0:30:19.32,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Do you have anything, Hon-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.32,0:30:21.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I want to go to a hot spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.08,0:30:22.64,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,A hot spring, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.96,0:30:22.46,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.64,0:30:24.56,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Wait, couldn't you go? There's still time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.56,0:30:28.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Since I have a month, surely I could manage one night away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.68,0:30:29.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I feel like I can make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.72,0:30:32.14,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I've been looking into it lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.14,0:30:34.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I have a lot of places on my list.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.80,0:30:39.18,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But whenever I think,\N"Oh, I could go here," my schedule doesn't quite work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.18,0:30:44.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Things keep overlapping,\Nso I'm aiming to finally go as a reward to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.20,0:30:45.08,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.08,0:30:46.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I hope I get to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.12,0:30:46.66,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.66,0:30:50.24,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,So with that, let's look forward to seeing how they answer next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.24,0:30:51.11,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Look forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.11,0:30:51.92,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.92,0:30:53.28,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,How was today for you, Hon-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.96,0:31:00.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,We said it's been a while,\Nbut since we were practicing together for the Thanks Festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.08,0:31:02.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,talking to you just brings back all those memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.44,0:31:03.28,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Comment: 0,0:31:04.16,0:31:05.12,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.16,0:31:05.12,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.12,0:31:08.60,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really goes by in a flash, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.60,0:31:11.44,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It'll be next year before we know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.44,0:31:13.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Next up is already the 7th anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.20,0:31:16.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Isn't that amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.04,0:31:16.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.04,0:31:19.51,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,We've known each other for a long time now, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.35,0:31:19.51,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,We really have.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.51,0:31:22.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,When the four of us are together...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.00,0:31:24.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,How should I put it? The atmosphere...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.00,0:31:26.20,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It almost feels like we're a family now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.20,0:31:28.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's like being at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.46,0:31:29.56,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's so comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.60,0:31:29.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Like a family reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.96,0:31:32.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,We just talk and talk the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.64,0:31:37.08,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Hon-chan, that Setlog you did was really popular!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.95,0:31:39.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Wait, really? Was it okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.48,0:31:42.74,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Everyone was saying it was so Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.74,0:31:48.96,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,They said the way you barely filmed anything\Nin the Setlog was so Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.96,0:31:50.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.48,0:31:53.45,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, because Shizuku isn't good with technology and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.04,0:31:55.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm glad it worked out that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.08,0:31:57.32,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Everyone had a lot of fun with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.32,0:31:58.80,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,But let's take another one with the four of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.80,0:32:00.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I want a chance to redeem myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.60,0:32:00.68,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,"Redeem," haha.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.68,0:32:06.22,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So what happened was, Yui-chan messaged the group and invited us to make a Setlog,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.22,0:32:10.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,but at the time, I was like, "What's a Setlog?"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.68,0:32:10.16,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,Ah, so you didn't know what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.16,0:32:16.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I looked it up and saw it was an app,\Nso I thought I'd download it before we met up again.
Comment: 0,0:32:16.48,0:32:17.54,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.48,0:32:17.54,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So I downloaded the app.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.54,0:32:19.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And I even made an account.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.24,0:32:23.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I thought I was all set, but when we met up that morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.92,0:32:30.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I hadn't done anything.\NIt didn't even occur to me that I should be taking vids...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.14,0:32:34.79,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,What was it? Your banana, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.64,0:32:34.79,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,My morning banana. In the green room...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.60,0:32:37.13,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Hon-chan just had that one photo...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.01,0:32:40.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, that was when Mayushi showed me how to actually take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.48,0:32:42.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She walked me through it on my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.24,0:32:45.26,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She was like, "If you do this and that, then you take the video."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.26,0:32:51.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She said, "There, you're all set!" so I just posted the banana since it was right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.48,0:32:56.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I was like, "Alright, all done!" so after that,\NI just photobombed everyone else's pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.68,0:33:00.24,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, everyone was saying that was so Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.24,0:33:01.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.60,0:33:04.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But next time, I'll make sure to take a photo every hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.12,0:33:05.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'll definitely find something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.52,0:33:07.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And I'll keep my phone with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.72,0:33:09.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'll get my revenge next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.58,0:33:09.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.72,0:33:10.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.28,0:33:13.60,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Well then, it's time for us to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.60,0:33:15.36,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Your hosts were Yui Ogura and...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.36,0:33:17.08,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,Rina Honnizumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.08,0:33:19.10,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.84,0:33:19.10,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
